over the month compared with about 40 at ×1.1.\n- **×1.2 or more (plans 7 and 0):** the extra 10% of purchases costs about 1390. It only saves about 950 in sales and avoided penalties. The rest is written off or left over at the end.\n- **×1.1:** this is the best spot. The safety buffer grows slowly and stays well short of the 8-day shelf life.\n\n**Things no plan can avoid.** All plans run short of product 0 on day 1 and of product 1 on days 0–3, because the first deliveries arrive on days 2 and 4. Candidate 2 covers the demand spikes on days 17 and 22 on time. Its biggest stock level is about 200 units on day 22, which is under the 220 limit."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 357, "cache_read_input_tokens": 6882, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 357}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-25T18:59:26.826Z", "request_id": "req_011CgPU7YxqyzVNfQX9cQvvc"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01RyXZZcN35F6aSrfoCUzNy1", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgPU7ZEEDzVpKAj5MF6ie", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01RyXZZcN35F6aSrfoCUzNy1", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"choice": 2}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache